abstract: >-
  Operationalized agent-governance criteria with adversarial testing
  scenarios: 26 controls across 5 domains (Authority Governance,
  Observability, Interoperability, Safety & Reliability, Adversarial
  Resilience). Compliance is assessed through adversarial testing
  against live systems and verified through cryptographic evidence.
